	<message id="formation_tacticalstyle_title">Tactical identity</message>
	<message id="formation_tacticalstyle_select">Playing style</message>
	<message id="formation_tacticalstyle_fit">Fit</message>
	<message id="formation_tacticalstyle_effect_help">Tactical identity has only a small effect in matches and mainly rewards a good fit between style, squad, training and staff.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_balanced">Balanced</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_balanced_help">Neutral style without strict specialisation. Base strength, technique, stamina, passing, tackling and freshness are weighted evenly.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_defensive">Defensive</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_defensive_help">Tackling, heading, stamina and influential players strengthen a compact defensive style.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_possession">Possession</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_possession_help">Strong passing, technique, creativity and flair help this style.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_counterattack">Counterattack</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_counterattack_help">Pace, finishing, passing and freshness are especially well suited to quick transitions.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_pressing">Pressing</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_pressing_help">Stamina, pace, tackling and mentality make pressing more stable.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_defensive_block">Defensive block</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_defensive_block_help">Tackling, heading, stamina and influence strengthen a compact block.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_wing_play">Wing play</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_wing_play_help">Pace, passing, flair and creativity encourage attacks down the flanks.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_set_pieces">Set pieces</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_set_pieces_help">Free kicks, heading, finishing and influence increase set-piece strength.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_youth_focused">Youth focus</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_youth_focused_help">High potential, young players, freshness and leaders suit this style.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_physical">Physical</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_physical_help">Stamina, heading, tackling and base strength are decisive here.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_fit_good">Your squad is very well suited to this style.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_fit_neutral">Your squad is reasonably well suited to this style.</message>
	<message id="tacticalstyle_fit_bad">This style is currently only partly suited to your squad.</message>
